  "description": "A durable Entity Framework Core dead-letter sink for OrionRelay. Implements the existing IDeadLetterSink over a relational table, so webhook deliveries that exhaust their attempt budget survive a process restart. Persists the target endpoint, payload, headers, attempt count, final error, and timestamps, is idempotent on the delivery id when a terminal delivery is re-routed, and exposes a query path for inspection and triage. References Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Relational only, so the consumer chooses the database provider.",
